menu "Tab5 application"
    config TAB5_LCD_PIXEL_CLOCK_MHZ
        int "Original ILI9881C LCD pixel clock (MHz)"
        range 30 60
        default 60
        help
            Pixel clock for the original Tab5 ILI9881C 720 x 1280 panel.
            60 MHz gives approximately 48 Hz scanout and is the tested native
            rate. Trials at 40 and 50 MHz caused visible instability on the
            original panel. Lower clocks require separate timing validation.
            Other panel revisions keep their BSP timings.
endmenu
